data: {"id": "2eba48ab35c54ecd-thinking-parallel_evidence-1047", "run_id": "2eba48ab35c54ecd", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我有充分事实了。让我整理证据：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Kubernetes 生命周期状态\n- **Pod 仍处于 Pending**：`phase=Pending`，`nodeName=None`，与 upstream 摘要一致。\n- **Pod UID**: `78de30b1-06ec-4314-9120-26d93c29a48a`，Prometheus 指标中的 UID 与 K8s 一致，排除了 Pod 重建/UID 复用导致的状态漂移。\n\n### 2. FailedScheduling 事件原文（根因直接证据）\n`default-scheduler` 反复 13 次（持续 64 分钟）返回：\n> **\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.\"**\n\n**这明确指向 node affinity/selector 不匹配，而非资源不足。**\n\n### 3. Node Affinity/Selector 配置（原因定位）\n- **Pod 的 `node", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788764479476, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "2eba48ab35c54ecd-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "2eba48ab35c54ecd", "seq": 1048, "ts_ms": 1788764487740, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 38.302, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-01", "name": "workload-68c557d875-bsq52"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/2eba48ab35c54ecd-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "1091615e1379fa95db41a9ef1636f59c862aa98c161610379ccfb432ba1a5f3a", "bytes": 2451}, "snapshot_sha256": "4aab1d6a631f6b81bcdda0629251bf30982c71ad341aed5d130b9cdfe3c09dca"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "2eba48ab35c54ecd-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "2eba48ab35c54ecd", "seq": 1049, "ts_ms": 1788764487741, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "2eba48ab35c54ecd-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "2eba48ab35c54ecd", "seq": 1050, "ts_ms": 1788764496310, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.569, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1450, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52 处于 Pending 状态，持续 64 分钟未调度 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubernetes` | `Warning FailedScheduling ... 4m8s (x13 over 64m) ... 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.` | 确认调度失败的根本原因是亲和性/选择器不匹配，故障持续 64 分钟。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `kubernetes` | `pod.condition` PodScheduled=False, `phase=Pending` | 确认 Pod 目前处于无法进入运行的等待状态。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `kubernetes` | `container.resource_request.cpu=5m`, `memory=8Mi` | 资源请求极小，排除因资源耗尽导致调度失败的可能。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `prometheus` | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}=1` | 独立监控数据证实该 Pod 确实长时间处于 Pending 状态。 |\n\n**证据关联说明**：\nKubernetes Event (fact-b080c874492b) 直接指出调度失败是因为“didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector”。Metric 监控 (fact-368585a9fc5d) 证实 Pod 状态与 Pod 资源请求量极小 (fact-0415e5265c11) 的事实不冲突，排除了资源不足导致无节点可用的情况。日志和追踪无数据是因容器未启动。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了 nodeSelector 约束 → 集群所有节点（3个）不满足该标签匹配规则 → Scheduler 触发 FailedScheduling → Pod 状态保持 Pending 达 64 分钟\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 的调度约束与集群节点标签不匹配。\n\n根据事实 `fact-b080c874492b`（FailedScheduling 事件）与 `fact-227f115934b4`（Unschedulable 状态），Pod 因为 `node affinity/selector` 不匹配而失败，3个节点均未被选中。结合 `fact-0415e5265c11` 和 `fact-8dd5efe3b187` 极小的资源请求（5m CPU, 8Mi 内存），可排除资源瓶颈，确认为逻辑标签匹配失败导致无法调度。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52 处于 Pending 状态，持续 64 分钟未调度 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubernetes` | `Warning FailedScheduling ... 4m8s (x13 over 64m) ... 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.` | 确认调度失败的根本原因是亲和性/选择器不匹配，故障持续 64 分钟。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `kubernetes` | `pod.condition` PodScheduled=False, `phase=Pending` | 确认 Pod 目前处于无法进入运行的等待状态。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `kubernetes` | `container.resource_request.cpu=5m`, `memory=8Mi` | 资源请求极小，排除因资源耗尽导致调度失败的可能。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `prometheus` | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}=1` | 独立监控数据证实该 Pod 确实长时间处于 Pending 状态。 |\n\n**证据关联说明**：\nKubernetes Event (fact-b080c874492b) 直接指出调度失败是因为“didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector”。Metric 监控 (fact-368585a9fc5d) 证实 Pod 状态与 Pod 资源请求量极小 (fact-0415e5265c11) 的事实不冲突，排除了资源不足导致无节点可用的情况。日志和追踪无数据是因容器未启动。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了 nodeSelector 约束 → 集群所有节点（3个）不满足该标签匹配规则 → Scheduler 触发 FailedScheduling → Pod 状态保持 Pending 达 64 分钟\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 的调度约束与集群节点标签不匹配。\n\n根据事实 `fact-b080c874492b`（FailedScheduling 事件）与 `fact-227f115934b4`（Unschedulable 状态），Pod 因为 `node affinity/selector` 不匹配而失败，3个节点均未被选中。结合 `fact-0415e5265c11` 和 `fact-8dd5efe3b187` 极小的资源请求（5m CPU, 8Mi 内存），可排除资源瓶颈，确认为逻辑标签匹配失败导致无法调度。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

